      "Original": "Quick Upload allows you to bypass the upload user interface and perform uploads in one click by holding Left Shift when clicking upload. The entire upload process will run in the background and use your default privacy settings. If all opcodes are not available for censoring, the warning will not appear, and the upload will continue.",
