      "Original": "The 'metrics time' is how long from the time of upload that it will take for your captures to appear in the Chronofoil metrics system for developers to query. This does not prevent an individual from querying the metrics system and recreating your capture, but it makes it incredibly difficult, while still providing useful information to developers. This setting is your default time and will be set automatically for uploads, but can be overridden at upload time.",
      "Translated": "“指标时间”是指从上传之时起，您的捕获出现在Chronofoil指标系统中供开发者查询所需的时间。这并不能阻止个人查询指标系统并重建您的捕获，但会使其变得极其困难，同时仍能为开发者提供有用的信息。此设置是您的默认时间，上传时将自动设置，但可在上传时覆盖。",
      "Context": "SettingsTab.Draw",
      "Source": "user",
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGuiComponents.HelpMarker"
    },
    {
      "Original": "The 'public time' is how long from the time of upload that it will take for your captures to be available for raw download. This provides the full capture file to individuals, which allows them to do whatever - extract information, places visited, or even replay the packet capture on their own machine if they have that capability. This setting is your default time and will be set automatically for uploads, but can be overridden at upload time",
      "Translated": "“公开时间”是指从上传之时起，您的捕获可供原始下载所需的时间。这会向个人提供完整的捕获文件，使他们能够做任何事——提取信息、访问过的地点，甚至在他们自己的机器上重放数据包捕获（如果他们有此能力）。此设置是您的默认时间，上传时将自动设置，但可在上传时覆盖。",
      "Context": "SettingsTab.Draw",
      "Source": "ai:deepseek",
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGuiComponents.HelpMarker"
    },
    {
      "Original": "The minimum Metrics time is 7 days from the date of upload.",
      "Translated": "最短指标时间为上传之日起 7 天。",
      "Context": "SettingsTab.Draw",
      "Source": "ai:deepseek",
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGui.TextColoredWrapped"
    },
    {
      "Original": "The minimum Public time is 14 days from the date of upload.",
