      "PreserveID": true,
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ 窗口标题"
    },
    {
      "Original": "Chronofoil tracks these on your game client - if you've sent a censorable packet, Chronofoil will know its opcode and censor it accordingly.",
      "Translated": "Chronofoil会在你的游戏客户端上追踪这些操作——如果你发送过可审查的数据包，光阴之翼会知道它的操作码并相应地进行审查。",
      "Context": "UploadModal.DrawCensorNotice",
      "Source": "user",
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGui.TextWrapped"
    },
    {
      "Original": "However, you can opt to not upload now and try again later when all censorable opcodes are known.",
      "Translated": "不过，你可以选择现在不上传，等所有可审查的操作码都已知后再试。",
